X:1
T:From Heaven Above To Earth I Come
T:VOM HIMMEL HOCH
C:Music: traditional German from Schumann's Geistliche Lieder, Leipzig, 1539 · Words: Martin Luther, 1535. translated by Catherine Winkworth, 1855
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Common Service Book with Hymnal', ULCA 1918 Hymn 19.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/vom_himmel_hoch_luther): 100% of pitches and 94% of note lengths agree.
